B.Oy=new A.lC("education-access","Education Access",u.m,"Our Education Access program partners with local communities to build classrooms, train teachers, and distribute books and learning materials. Since 2018 we've opened 14 schools and supported over 3,000 students across 6 countries. We focus on regions where the nearest school is more than a day's walk away, and work with local governments to ensure long-term sustainability once we hand off operations.",B.l_,0.72,"$180,000","$129,600","Education")
B.Ox=new A.lC("healthcare-outreach","Healthcare Outreach",u.x,"Mobile medical units travel to communities with no permanent healthcare access, providing checkups, vaccinations, maternal care, and essential medicine. Each unit is staffed by a rotating team of volunteer doctors and local health workers, reaching roughly 40 villages a year.",B.kY,0.58,"$220,000","$127,600","Healthcare")
B.Ot=new A.lC("disaster-relief","Disaster Relief",u.b,"When disaster strikes, our rapid-response teams deploy within 48 hours with food, clean water, and emergency shelter kits. We maintain pre-positioned supply caches in 5 regions specifically so response time stays fast when it matters most.",B.l0,0.85,"$300,000","$255,000","Emergency")
B.Ow=new A.lC("clean-water","Clean Water Initiative","Drilling wells and installing filtration systems in water-scarce regions.","Access to clean water reduces disease and frees up hours in the day, especially for women and children who often walk miles to collect water. We've drilled 62 wells and installed community filtration systems serving over 45,000 people.",B.p0,0.63,"$150,000","$94,500","Infrastructure")
B.Ou=new A.lC("womens-empowerment","Women's Empowerment","Vocational training and microloans for women entrepreneurs.","This program provides vocational training, small-business mentorship, and microloans to women in the communities we serve, helping them build sustainable income sources and financial independence.",B.p1,0.41,"$90,000","$36,900","Economic")
B.Ov=new A.lC("child-nutrition","Child Nutrition","School feeding programs to fight childhood malnutrition.","Daily nutritious meals at partner schools improve both health outcomes and school attendance. The program currently feeds over 8,000 children each school day.",B.oZ,0.77,"$130,000","$100,100","Health")
B.pj=s([B.Oy,B.Ox,B.Ot,B.Ow,B.Ou,B.Ov],A.al("y<lC>"))
